// Agent-tooling carve-out. Merges with the root `.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc` rather than
// replacing it, so every other rule still applies here.
//
// MD041 wants a top-level heading first. These prompts open with frontmatter and then a
// role statement, and they are size-constrained, so the rule does not apply to them. It
// stays on everywhere else in the repository.
{
	"config": {
		"MD041": false,
	},
}
